{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal configuration using PCA-n2000 RNA and ResNet50 image encoders, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5232 (F1: 0.5084), slightly lower than the concat fusion baseline (0.5266, F1: 0.5104). The result suggests weighted fusion may not outperform concatenation in this setup, but the small difference requires further validation. Uncertainty remains about the impact of fusion strategy without direct comparison to single-modality baselines or alternative design choices."
}

